      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Although our first contact with this company was phone marketing, they were very polite and handled my questions honestly. At that stage we hadn't any intention of installing solar. However, when their salesperson came from Melbourne and talked to us, the solar sounded more appealing. That was when I contacted you and asked for other quotes. Although some of the quotes were less than the  Evergreen one, we asked them to return for another consultation. German Hanover Polycrystalline silicon high-power with a peak power of 250W sounded good. Of course we only had their word of that - we really didn't know. My husband was convinced, and we even upgraded from a 3KW to a 4.5KW system with 18 panels instead of 12. Everything went to plan, the installation men came at the right time and were polite and efficient and the Inspector and the Powercor man, likewise. So now we just have to wait and see if it works out as well as they said it would!I'm sure the other companies you supplied us with would probably have been just as good. It was just that Evergreen came first.",
